<h1 id="e-connect360" sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="11">e-Connect360</h1>

<blockquote sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="12">
<p sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="12">Update: 14.08.2026</p>
</blockquote>
<p sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="14">Integrated business communication and data exchange platform for Dynamics 365 Business Central</p>
<p sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="16"><strong sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="16">The eConnect360</strong> application is a comprehensive integration platform that extends Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central with powerful tools for electronic communication, EDI integration, document exchange, and data synchronization.
Designed for organizations that need to connect Business Central with customers, suppliers, partners, and external systems, eConnect360 provides a scalable and reliable framework for automating business processes, eliminating manual data entry, and ensuring seamless information flow across the enterprise.
Whether you need to exchange electronic documents, automate EDI communication, synchronize master data between systems, or integrate Business Central with third-party applications, eConnect360 delivers everything in a single solution.</p>
<table sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="20">
<thead>
