<tr sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="22">
<td sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="22">Synchronize master data and selected business records between multiple Business Central companies, environments, and external systems from a single central source.</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="22"><a href="centraldatabase.html" sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="22">Central Database</a></td>
</tr>
<tr sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="23">
<td sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="23">Automate the exchange of orders, invoices, delivery notes, and other business documents with customers and suppliers using structured electronic messages.</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="23"><a href="edi-connector-basic.html" sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="23">EDI (Electronic Data Interchange)</a></td>
</tr>
<tr sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="24">
<td sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="24">Automatically distribute invoices, credit memos, and other documents through configurable electronic channels and partner-specific communication profiles.</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="24"><a href="electronic-documents.html" sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="24">Electronic Documents Sending</a></td>
</tr>
<tr sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="25">
<td sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="25">Provide reliable bi-directional communication and data exchange between Business Central and external applications using various communication channels and formats.</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="25"><a href="spooler.html" sourcefile="Solutions/e-connect360.md" sourcestartlinenumber="25">Spooler</a></td>
